, and Trauma-Related Disorders", "description": "Understand common anxiety, OCD, trauma, and stressor-related presentations and supports.", "children": [{"id": "3aa29093-df94-4fa1-9fa1-84bc54ec003e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Anxiety presentations", "children": [{"id": "6d0528f8-e7ac-4775-8965-276323def301", "type": "concept", "title": "Generalized anxiety"}, {"id": "5f552fc6-2c55-47d1-a823-2a920466c903", "type": "concept", "title": "Panic"}, {"id": "71cb6849-9357-4d70-a4ef-333610b49ac9", "type": "concept", "title": "Social anxiety"}, {"id": "4696b0c4-277a-46b9-95dc-82b849f3c909", "type": "concept", "title": "Phobias and avoidance"}], "description": "Students learn common anxiety presentations and how anxiety can affect functioning."}, {"id": "4e128bc8-4844-49b5-8772-66793f16c680", "type": "subtopic", "title": "OCD and related concerns", "children": [{"id": "cea17f79-2fc6-43c7-822a-72177296dad8", "type": "concept", "title": "Obsessions and compulsions"}, {"id": "5a89c0a3-f949-4882-ae55-6c296e4c76e6", "type": "concept", "title": "Body-focused repetitive behaviors"}, {"id": "49bd5f31-8698-4593-87cc-6caa9719b7cf", "type": "concept", "title": "Insight and distress"}, {"id": "a8825147-f032-43b0-8729-2c13ef72b629", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence-based referral pathways"}], "description": "This subtopic introduces obsessions, compulsions, and related patterns without turning students into diagnosticians."}, {"id": "a6f8aa09-b850-4d03-90fb-9b35232f3638", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Trauma and stressor-related concerns", "children": [{"id": "f4677be0-13f3-4861-ae87-7874d2560e29", "type": "concept", "title": "PTSD basics"}, {"id": "beb9c902-0029-4eb9-a709-9234f1a09369", "type": "concept", "title": "Acute and chronic trauma"}, {"id": "971db476-ed57-4ac5-937d-a3b487521a58", "type": "concept", "title": "Complex trauma"}, {"id": "81e8bb50-25ee-4ad4-b8ca-d0f08d111dd2", "type": "concept", "title": "Grounding and stabilization concepts"}], "description": "Students learn how trauma can shape symptoms, relationships, body responses, and service engagement."}]}, {"id": "e11aac65-f110-4fb9-b941-6268aa46b7b4", "type": "topic", "title": "Mood Disorders and Suicide-Risk Awareness", "description": "Study depressive and bipolar-related disorders with special attention to suicide-risk assessment and safety.", "children": [{"id": "a2a9685f-60fd-4e5a-af6a-c6b53a8e53ec", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Depressive disorders", "children": [{"id": "72cc0c88-58e0-4455-8f75-64de5471247c", "type": "concept", "title": "Major depression"}, {"id": "986794be-418f-42ff-8d52-828c0d1d2395", "type": "concept", "title": "Persistent depressive patterns"}, {"id": "04bf2094-ef14-40d4-a53c-56e37b181a28", "type": "concept", "title": "Grief and loss considerations"}, {"id": "aabadadf-a2cc-424a-aeb1-2ba2b92d9ab3", "type": "concept", "title": "Functional impairment and protective factors"}], "description": "Students learn core signs of depression and their impact on functioning and safety."}, {"id": "ff692eb9-f9b3-4e32-bcc8-e62f2d420035", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Bipolar-related disorders", "children": [{"id": "8a140d82-36f4-46a0-b1ac-1141890ac241", "type": "concept", "title": "Mania and hypomania basics"}, {"id": "673028b5-a87b-48d4-83d5-8edbb8e3bb8f", "type": "concept", "title": "Depressive episodes"}, {"id": "8aaa6e89-c046-438f-8720-4604e3a4c4fc", "type": "concept", "title": "Medication and psychiatry coordination"}, {"id": "5c3bab08-fb6c-4b5f-a0a9-218df93729cc", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk of misidentification"}], "description": "Students learn why mood elevation, decreased need for sleep, and cycling require careful assessment and referral."}, {"id": "4211b330-dcf0-49a0-9415-4adb7abc344e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Suicide-risk awareness", "children": [{"id": "10da5502-77ef-469a-a77a-157057a9e751", "type": "concept", "title": "Ideation, intent, plan, means, and past attempts"}, {"id": "8bd36290-0a52-46ba-bc0a-de0d30ade089", "type": "concept", "titl