related emergencies"}], "description": "Students learn to identify behavioral health crises and respond calmly."}, {"id": "61e61476-8555-4cf2-beac-b7f8376f2860", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Safety planning basics", "children": [{"id": "0baa17c3-078d-4e96-b510-b8bc1021b086", "type": "concept", "title": "Warning signs"}, {"id": "a0839986-adec-44d6-9dcf-71233110e0a6", "type": "concept", "title": "Internal coping strategies"}, {"id": "cba45d85-d91c-4eca-a336-eaed339807e8", "type": "concept", "title": "Social supports"}, {"id": "ee86e5b2-254e-4a1b-a8ef-587b1aa98e6a", "type": "concept", "title": "Professional and emergency resources"}], "description": "Safety planning translates risk assessment into practical next steps."}, {"id": "25e9da08-f6cc-446a-8f93-fd0ad04c7fb9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Coordinated care and documentation", "children": [{"id": "51cc8eb0-9c0e-4f5c-a591-f09f4715aaec", "type": "concept", "title": "Consultation and supervision"}, {"id": "84967c95-af9f-4620-a34e-041121b7f2cb", "type": "concept", "title": "Warm handoffs"}, {"id": "464808a7-5086-404e-9568-231966f793a8", "type": "concept", "title": "Crisis lines and mobile crisis"}, {"id": "a66ff883-2376-40af-a26e-42d61db21192", "type": "concept", "title": "Documentation of risk and referrals"}], "description": "Crisis work requires communication, consultation, and clear records."}]}, {"id": "b6385a1d-96eb-4cfa-8dca-7ef132b45da2", "type": "topic", "title": "Recovery, Resilience, Family, Peer, and Community Supports", "description": "Explore recovery-oriented practice, resilience, family impact, peer support, and community resources.", "children": [{"id": "deacf5fe-4ec1-4d9d-8929-8d6d67dbad34", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Recovery and resilience", "children": [{"id": "24d280ef-10e1-4c29-a74a-7e5e7f5c08b8", "type": "concept", "title": "Hope and self-direction"}, {"id": "2b5e2dda-951d-4359-a953-14a81d48d3fd", "type": "concept", "title": "Strengths and meaning"}, {"id": "fd710b07-2747-4920-b875-5511c1