s learn how trauma can shape symptoms, relationships, body responses, and service engagement."}]}, {"id": "e11aac65-f110-4fb9-b941-6268aa46b7b4", "type": "topic", "title": "Mood Disorders and Suicide-Risk Awareness", "description": "Study depressive and bipolar-related disorders with special attention to suicide-risk assessment and safety.", "children": [{"id": "a2a9685f-60fd-4e5a-af6a-c6b53a8e53ec", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Depressive disorders", "children": [{"id": "72cc0c88-58e0-4455-8f75-64de5471247c", "type": "concept", "title": "Major depression"}, {"id": "986794be-418f-42ff-8d52-828c0d1d2395", "type": "concept", "title": "Persistent depressive patterns"}, {"id": "04bf2094-ef14-40d4-a53c-56e37b181a28", "type": "concept", "title": "Grief and loss considerations"}, {"id": "aabadadf-a2cc-424a-aeb1-2ba2b92d9ab3", "type": "concept", "title": "Functional impairment and protective factors"}], "description": "Students learn core signs of depression and their impact on functioning and safety."}, {"id": "ff692eb9-f9b3-4e32-bcc8-e62f2d420035", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Bipolar-related disorders", "children": [{"id": "8a140d82-36f4-46a0-b1ac-1141890ac241", "type": "concept", "title": "Mania and hypomania basics"}, {"id": "673028b5-a87b-48d4-83d5-8edbb8e3bb8f", "type": "concept", "title": "Depressive episodes"}, {"id": "8aaa6e89-c046-438f-8720-4604e3a4c4fc", "type": "concept", "title": "Medication and psychiatry coordination"}, {"id": "5c3bab08-fb6c-4b5f-a0a9-218df93729cc", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk of misidentification"}], "description": "Students learn why mood elevation, decreased need for sleep, and cycling require careful assessment and referral."}, {"id": "4211b330-dcf0-49a0-9415-4adb7abc344e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Suicide-risk awareness", "children": [{"id": "10da5502-77ef-469a-a77a-157057a9e751", "type": "concept", "title": "Ideation, intent, plan, means, and past attempts"}, {"id": "8bd36290-0a52-46ba-bc0a-de0d30ade089", "type": "concept"